 Crusader</a>.</li>\n<li>Use of this ability consumes a \"spell slot,\" limiting the amount of creatures each Umbral Tremor can summon. The number of slots possessed by each tremor is variable and ranges between one and four.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715050110\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.102 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.107 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3636/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 112336/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 39308/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 38/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1670492/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n123.33%  101.693     47 Template:Trim\n100.00%   82.459      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   82.459      1 -total\n 40.18%   33.129      4 Template:Creature\n 27.47%   22.654      4 Template:Creature/format\n 26.14%   21.554      4 Template:AttributeBlock\n 22.00%   18.140      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 11.75%    9.690      5 Template:Template_style\n 11.40%    9.403     24 Template:IfEmpty\n  9.33%    7.692      1 Template:Resource\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31730-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715050110 and revision id 295399. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}